# Repos a reviewer of THIS repo may search and cite, materialized under
# .siblings/<owner>/<repo>. Declared rather than left to the fallback so
# the set is the one this repo actually depends on.
#
# One per line. The reviewer host must also carry a SOURCE_PATHS entry for
# each, or the sibling reports as `missing` and is never searched.
#
# Each row is an edge this repo actually has: agent-mgr deploys it and owns the
# compose template and the plugin pin, plow owns the relay and the chat trust
# state, hermes-plow-chat is the plow_chat plugin that frames every turn. The
# peer variants that used to be listed here own nothing this repo consumes.
# plow-hermes-agent is not a build input (this image is FROM upstream) but its
# README map and seed SOUL.md are what the gate compares persona text against.

plow-pbc/agent-mgr
plow-pbc/plow
plow-pbc/hermes-plow-chat
plow-pbc/plow-hermes-agent
